WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.350 align:start position:0%
 
[Music]  here comes the bride  with a military guard a moment of levity  for one unit responsible for guarding  the capital kyiv  [Music]  the unit's part of the territory of  defense and is made up of volunteer  soldiers  war often reduces humans to basics water  food shelter survival  but this territorial defense unit is  celebrating the stuff that makes life  worth living  the proud couple hold their wedding gift  as they get their pictures taken  of course we are the happiest  we are a little stressed i didn't expect  so much attention  under ukrainian martial law the unit  commander can officiate a wedding  something he says he was honored to do  this is exactly why we are having the  ceremony we want to show the world that  life goes on despite the war people get  married they don't stop being happy they  don't stop smiling and they have  something to look forward to for the  future  it's an unusual start to married life  and one this couple will remember for a  long time  the ceremony however was brief lasting  just under 20 minutes and the unit is  straight back to duty there's no time  for a honeymoon or anything like that  the groom is actually going back to the  front lines and everybody else is going  back to their positions as well but it  just goes to show you even in wartime  love can blossom imran khan al jazeera  kiev

